      "start_seconds": 0.75,
      "end_seconds": 6.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.92,
      "end_seconds": 11.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.12,
      "end_seconds": 20.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got chest tightness when I walk uphill."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.43,
      "end_seconds": 24.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.04,
      "end_seconds": 31.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Hmm, for about three months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.0,
      "end_seconds": 37.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.66,
      "end_seconds": 50.92,
      "duration_seconds": 12.26,
      "text": "uh, it's all the time. I'd give it a seven, out of ten. It's the not knowing that gets to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.54,
      "end_seconds": 55.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.97,
      "end_seconds": 69.32,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "it usually comes with pain in my jaw. The pain in my jaw? That's been since yesterday. About pain in my jaw, exertion definitely sets it off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.79,
      "end_seconds": 89.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "have you had palpitations, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.81,
      "end_seconds": 94.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.03,
      "end_seconds": 102.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Any fainting or leg swelling at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.73,
      "end_seconds": 107.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.62,
      "end_seconds": 110.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "alright, neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.04,
      "end_seconds": 112.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "nothing odd there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.68,
      "end_seconds": 118.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.0,
      "end_seconds": 140.59,
      "duration_seconds": 21.59,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I grab fast food at lunch most days. My husband and I live above the shop. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.85,
      "end_seconds": 161.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.94,
      "end_seconds": 164.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.61,
      "end_seconds": 169.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Right, any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.31,
      "end_seconds": 176.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Mm, I had a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.81,
      "end_seconds": 190.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.98,
      "end_seconds": 197.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.78,
      "end_seconds": 200.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.12,
      "end_seconds": 216.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.75,
      "end_seconds": 241.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 97 percent, temperature 36.7. And blood pressure 114 over 82, heart rate 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.98,
      "end_seconds": 246.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "right, let's have a a proper look at you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.54,
      "end_seconds": 248.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.85,
      "end_seconds": 251.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.74,
      "end_seconds": 270.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Your heart sounds are normal and the pulses are all present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.65,
      "end_seconds": 275.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.72,
      "end_seconds": 290.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with stable angina."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.36,
      "end_seconds": 294.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.38,
      "end_seconds": 318.4,
      "duration_seconds": 22.02,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's stable angina, and we'll know more once the an exercise test is back i'll request an exercise test, it'll help with exertional chest tightness what I'm giving you is glyceryl trinitrate spray, 400 micrograms, when needed, long term it's for chest tightness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.81,
      "end_seconds": 324.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.76,
      "end_seconds": 335.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.58,
      "text": "Stop and rest when the tightness starts, and use the spray if it does not ease in a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.84,
      "end_seconds": 348.67,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Come back after the tests. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.47,
      "end_seconds": 354.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Right, you know, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.15,
      "end_seconds": 356.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
